  <metadata>
    <name>Coldwater Rumble 100 Mile course</name>
    <desc>Track coordinates copy the 7,104-point "100 Mile" line from Aravaipa Running's CalTopo map (caltopo.com/m/UUDUK23), exported 2026-08-13 and linked from the official race page and the 2026 Runner Guide: two Red Loops then three Blue Loops from Rumble HQ, measuring 101.0 miles against the guide's 101.2. Station waypoints are the organizer's CalTopo markers. The line carries no elevations.</desc>
    <link href="https://caltopo.com/m/UUDUK23"><text>Coldwater Rumble CalTopo course map</text></link>
  </metadata>
